WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Next, the three of you will safely stay at the camp to avoid danger and cultivate yourself.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,080
Ruoyu and I went out to hunt for treasures

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,640
There will always be gains in the future

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:08,960
I’ll still give you the 10% guarantee of beauty’s share, so you can rest.

5
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,240
But I definitely don’t want to split it

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,840
We already take up enough light

7
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,720
You're right in Baina, I really have no shame in staying in the team.

8
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,480
We have given too much and we deserve it.

9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,680
So put it aside beforehand. It will get dark soon and hurry up to set up camp.

10
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,900
2.7 million corpses in three parts and nine parts

11
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:27,900
Eight spiritual star fruits guarantee a minimum of RMB 60 million

12
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,420
That adds up to nearly 70 million

13
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,110
I have never seen so much cash in my life

14
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:35,270
It’s as much as my company’s total profit for the year

15
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,110
Can you restrain yourself a little?

16
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:40,260
Don't go around showing off your wealth when you get excited, but let's be honest

17
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:43,380
Faced with such a payment, I suddenly

18
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,300
I don’t even know how to plan and use it

19
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,800
It's just like this gift that I didn't pick up.

20
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,400
Deduct 20% from the sponsor

21
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,680
You beauties get 10%

22
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,560
Ruoyu and I share the remaining 70% equally

23
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,040
Follow team rules

24
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:58,400
Team members can buy Spirit Star Fruit at 20% off, right? I want to buy one.

25
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,960
Give the Purple Clothed Flying Snake self-nurturing spiritual essence

26
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:02,720
The fees will be deducted directly from my share of the transaction.

27
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:08,710
I don’t know what changes will happen to Xiaobai next
